# Copy values into .env.local for personal overrides (gitignored).
# Modes: development (npm run dev) · uat · pre · production (npm run build)

# API calls use same-origin /api. Set VITE_API_BASE_URL only to point at another host.
# SSO is on unless VITE_SSO_ENABLED=false. That flag belongs in .env.development, not here:
# .env.local is loaded for every Vite mode, including uat / pre / production builds.
